  "preamble": "Affrication of the voiceless palatal stop [c] to the alveolo-palatal affricate [tɕ]. Proto-Tai *c, reconstructed as a palatal stop by Pittayaporn (2009), corresponds to the Thai affricate จ /tɕ/; Li (1977) reconstructs the same series directly as affricates. In Vietnamese, Proto-Vietic *c is kept as the stop [c] in Saigon speech but became the affricate [tɕ] in Hanoi and Huế; in Hanoi it merged with tr.",
